WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.100
Welcome, Iman Meskini!

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.040
Thank you!

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.480
In order for us ...

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.200
In order for us to get you here in the show today ...

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.060
… We had to apply to the Norwegian Armed Forces …

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.340
… To grant you a leave …

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.420
To come here.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:36.680
And as far as I know, you arrived straight from there, and you woke up in ...

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.000
… what's the name, the hut?

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.560
In the barrack.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.420
This morning, and you were close to not making it here?

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.720
Yes. We get up at five every morning ...

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.540
And then …

00:00:48.545 --> 00:00:51.855
We thought everything was going to be easy because it's our last weeks as recruits ...

00:00:51.975 --> 00:00:55.165
So to be honest, we thought we were going to be able to just chill ...

00:00:55.165 --> 00:00:58.600
So people were just relaxing a little in the weekend.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.340
But at the same time we need to have the rooms in order.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:05.620
… the rooms need to be tidy all the time.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:07.680
… and they weren't this weekend.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.360
Which led to our officers getting complaints.

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:12.760
And then ...

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:16.420
We had to do an intense workout session this morning.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:19.980
… with lots of push-ups. The session was longer than we've ever had, I think!

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.120
As punishment?

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.440
Uh ... As a lesson, yes.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:26.860
Yes!

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:31.660
So my plan was to have time to shower and stuff like that before I came ... But I just ...

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.700
I've showered now, though!

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:35.800
You've entered into this completely voluntarily.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:36.520
Yes!

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:37.860
Why?

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:40.960
It's because I like challenges.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:44.980
You learn a lot of things in the Armed Forces …

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:46.440
… in a short amount of time …

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:50.640
… Which you never would've learnt in the civilian life.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:53.160
When playing «Sana» ...

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:55.340
And a lot of people think «Sana» when they see you ...

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:58.620
… Even in a uniform, we think «Sana» when we see you …

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:04.580
In the role as «Sana», you've received a lot of praise …

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:06.000
… both in Norway and Sweden, for …

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:11.000
… focusing on young muslims.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.120
You've helped visualize what it's like to be a young muslim …

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:15.960
… in Norway.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:17.560
In 2017.

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.340
Was that your plan?

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:21.320
Uh ...

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.140
Yes.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:23.800
It was.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.160
What were your thoughts?

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:33.800
Well, it's a big part of why I took the role.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:36.920
Because …

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.700
 

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:43.040
I think it's absolutely fantastic that a character like this is on TV.

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:44.400
And …

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.400
I'm so happy that I'm the one who got the opportunity to play that role.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:54.780
You've helped visualize what happens when someone has to live in between two different cultures.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.120
 

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.320
And ...

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:02.880
You've been wearing a hijab throughout the series.

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:03.980
 

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:06.960
You also wear a hijab in real life.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.060
And you call it a conversation starter.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.240
What do you mean by that?

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.660
You could compare it to wearing this uniform.

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:18.740
Because ... What we learn in the Armed Forces is that you don't wear a uniform …

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:19.940
You carry it.

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:22.960
Because you have the Norwegian flag on here …

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.700
And you've got the king's emblem on.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:28.520
And you're supposed to wear it with pride.

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:32.700
And it shows that you're proud to be …

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.580
… defending your country.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:38.460
And those are somewhat my thoughts on the hijab as well.

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:41.400
It's something I carry. And …

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.840
Even if …

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:47.100
… a lot of people choose to define this as a opressing garnment …

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.440
 

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.640
That's not what it is for me.

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:52.100
And I carry it with pride.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.840
And that's why I wear it.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:56.540
And those are conversations you want to have, not ones you would like to avoid?

00:03:56.940 --> 00:04:00.880
I ... I think those who have spoken ...

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:05.060
… Those who have spoken to me about Islam …

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.620
… know that that's like a button.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:09.300
You put in a quarter, and it's on?

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.300
Yup, and I'll just ...

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.600
Begin.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:15.040
So that's always something I'll be happy to discuss.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:20.960
For you, is this first and foremost a cultural garnment, or a religious one?

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.120
To me, it's a religious one.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.060
I'm very ...

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:29.160
I'm very particular about separating culture and religion.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.540
Because they are two separate issues.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.280
But a lot of people get those two mixed up these days.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:39.500
But I'm very much driven by the facts and what Islam says.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:40.560
And not what …

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.800
What Arabs say.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.400
So for me, it's a religious garnment.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.880
It's been frequently discussed …

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:52.180
Why is this so provoking to so many people.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:55.900
Because different items of clothing are provocative – for some the uniform can also be provocative …

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:56.500
Yes.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:03.660
And a part of what's being said is that there are some who …

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.460
…&nbsp;don't carry it voluntarily.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:06.100
Mhm.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.860
What they're forced to it.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.500
But as I understand it, that's not the case for you?

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:12.920
That's not been the case for meg.

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:16.300
But I also won't deny that …

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.420
…&nbsp;there could be situations where people are forced into it.

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:20.100
But …

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:23.280
What I'm fighting for is that …

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:24.920
For those who want to …

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.200
It should be allowed.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:29.760
Yes.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:32.960
What …

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:39.200
You're born in Norway but was raised partially in Syria.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:43.540
Yes. My mother is Norwegian. My father is from Tunisia.

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:45.360
But …

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.480
I don't speak Tunisian.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:48.700
I speak Syrian.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:51.020
Dialect, that is. They're both Arabic languages.

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:53.480
They're a little different from each other. Because …

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:57.660
When I was one year old, we moved to Syria.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:00.700
Because they thought it was a nice country. And it was, in those days.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.020
But I don't remember much.

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:08.360
When do you find it demanding to be a muslim in Norway?

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.360
I used to be very involved in society.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.960
And I used to read lots of news and …

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:16.680
I was always interested in joining discussions.

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:21.580
But then it ended up being too much …

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.580
Negativity.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.980
Against Islam and muslims.

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:28.560
So then …

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.620
And Islam is very personal to me.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:31.860
So then …

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.140
… when there's so much negativity …

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.360
... against Islam …

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:41.640
Then I can't help but taking it a bit personal.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:47.340
Then the only option was to stop being so involved in society.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:52.340
So I started to … Well, I haven't been politically …

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.740
… active or anything like that. So…

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:58.580
I don't read a lot of news.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:01.800
And I try to limit my input from the media.

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:04.300
You yourself are often portrayed in the media.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:10.160
And if you don't read a lot of newspapers, I can tell you that, quite often, there are pictures of you all over the place.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:12.480
I think ...

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:16.240
When I'm with you here now, I think that you're quite similar to «Sana» …

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.840
… apart from the uniform. But you're also completely different.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:22.120
Because you are – not quite as strict?

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:22.620
No.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:29.860
It doesn't feel like you have a strict side, do you have a secret, strict side …

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:32.720
… that you finally can show with this part?

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.360
Yes, it certainly surfaced!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.000
But …

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:39.540
I'm not really very strict.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.880
And I normally don't wear as much black …

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:45.640
Ah, because your character does that all the time?

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:47.060
Yes, all the time.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:50.360
So that meant I had to buy a lot of black hijabs.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:51.600
… Because I had to bring them myself.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.540
But these days, I've ended up in a lot of black.

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:57.640
Because «Sana» was supposed to wear black.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:00.140
And you got all the clothes from the TV set?

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.220
All the hijabs, you have them?

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.500
Yes, I've got the hijabs, they're mine.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:07.180
Yes. So now I've got quite a lot, actually.

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:08.760
Yes.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.040
It …

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:14.640
The show is now finished …

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:18.360
You've all gone your separate ways …

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:24.240
The other girls, for those of you who haven't seen it yet, if there are any …

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:29.220
There are five girls who are the main characters in the show, and they …

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:33.100
… are now, several of them, trying to make careers out of acting.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.420
Trying to pursue careers in acting.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:40.820
Except for you, who's sitting here in a uniform.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:41.860
Yes.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.320
How often do you guys get in touch?

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:47.060
We've got this chat.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:47.960
Where …

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:49.840
An online chat were you just …

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.460
On Facebook. On Messenger.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.000
Yes. So there's …

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.600
… Stuff happening there now and then.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:55.380
Yes.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.760
Bring us into this chat – what happens there?

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:00.060
Well, what happens there …

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:02.560
It's not …

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.020
... like I can share everything with you!

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:11.260
So this is a private chat where you are yourselves and not in character?

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.780
No, we're not our characters in there.

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:16.800
So everyone's in there, and we've got quite a few screenshots of ...

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.740
You see, we've got a pretty cool fanbase.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.560
Who ...

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:25.140
You can say that. And there's a lot of them, as well!

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:26.520
So there's a lot of …

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:30.220
… especially in Instagram, there's a lot of creative accounts.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:33.860
For instance, there's an account called «skambrows».

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:35.220
That …

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:40.600
… for some reason finds it very funny to find pictures of all the characters and just remove our eyebrows.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:45.520
And it's actually quite big!

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:50.000
So we'll be posting screenshots of stuff like that.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.400
We're keeping an eye on everything.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:52.840
… And we share it between us.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.480
Iman, thank you so much for being here tonight!

